38. c4 {Now, what is the cleanest finisher?} Rd7 {This is the best way to include the rook in the attack. It looks like it hangs, but what happens if we do it anyway?} 39. Qxd7 ({The game finished} 39. Qe3 Ng3+ 40. Qxg3 Qxg3 41. Rxd7 Qe5+ {White resigned, as he will lose one of his rooks in short order.} 42. Kd2 Qxf5) 39... Qf2+ 40. Kd3 Nc5+ {Black wins the queen, and the game.} *

