[PlyCount "8"]

38. Ke2 {At least once this game, I did use the Shankland Method correctly. But one time out of four was not enough to get on the scoreboard.} c4 39. Nxc4 (39. Qc3 Qg3 40. bxc4 Qc7 41. Qd4 {This was the first move that came after time control and a spot where I colossally failed at using the Shankland Method, even with a bunch of added time on the clock. We'll see it in our next exercise.}) 39... Rxc4 40. bxc4 Qxc4+ 41. Kf2 Qxa4 {Black definitely should not lose here.} *

