34... Re8 {What should we do here?} 35. d7 {What happens if I do it anyway?} (35. Rc5 $2 Kg6 {The pawns are stopped in their tracks, and Black is right back in the game.}) 35... Rxe5+ ({Surya tried to set up a blockade with} 35... Rd8 36. e6 Bh4 37. Kd5 {but my king is coming.}) 36. Kd4 {White makes a queen.} *

