1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nf3 Bb4+ 4. Bd2 Qe7 5. Nc3 b6 6. e3 O-O 7. Bd3 Bb7 8. O-O ({This is more accurate than} 8. a3 Bxc3 9. Bxc3 Ne4 {.}) 8... a5 9. a3 Bxc3 10. Bxc3 Ne4 11. Be1 f5 12. Nd2 Ng5 13. f4 Nf7 14. e4 Nh6 15. Qe2 d6 16. Nf3 Nd7 {I got a very pleasant position straight out of the opening, but at this point, I missed the cleanest way through. Let's see if you can do better.} *

