18... Rh7 {How does White win here?} 19. Bf6 {Well spotted.} gxf6 (19... Rc8 20. Bxg7 {There was no need to release the tension right away. The machine suggests f4! and claims Black should lose. Still, I shouldn't criticize Garry's decision too much since it quickly simplified the position to a very pleasant Berlin Endgame for White.}) 20. Nxf6# {Cute checkmate!} *

[Event "?"]
[Site "?"]
[Date "????.??.??"]
