14. Re1 {This is not a subtle move. White wants e4 - e5 . How should Black respond?} h5 {This is clearly the move Black wants to make to undermine White's kingside. It looks like ignoring e5 is asking for trouble, but... What happens if I do it anyway?} 15. e5 (15. g5 Nh7 16. h4 d5 17. e5 Nf8 {leads White nowhere.}) 15... Bxc2 16. Qxc2 Nb4 {Black saves the hanging knight with a gain of tempo; he will not lose material, and White is becoming overextended.} *

[Event "?"]
[Site "?"]
