15... Bd6 {Now, the move we really want to play is h6 . It looks like ... Be5 ruins our day, but we always ask, what happens if I do it anyway?} 16. h6 Be5 17. hxg7 {What happens if I do it anyway?} (17. Qd2 Qe7 {and Black is back in the game.}) 17... Bxd4 (17... Rg8 {is Black's best move, but hardly critical. If you believe that ... Rg8 is coming, you play h6 and hit the clock.} 18. Qd2 Rxg7 19. f4 {.}) 18. Bxd4 Rg8 19. Re3+ {Nice that the rook went to h3 !} Qe7 20. Rxe7+ Kxe7 21. Bg2 {Black has a miserable endgame. His pieces are super stuck. Still, White needs to be energetic to make use of the advantage. A rook is a rook, after all.} *

