1. d4 d5 2. c4 c6 3. Nf3 Nf6 4. Nc3 e6 5. Bg5 h6 6. Bh4 Nbd7 ({A weird mix. Black should play} 6... dxc4 7. e4 g5 8. Bg3 b5 {.}) 7. e3 g5 8. Bg3 Nh5 9. Qc2 Nxg3 10. hxg3 Bg7 11. O-O-O Qe7 12. Kb1 O-O {Black has no time to try and castle queenside.} (12... Nb6 13. c5 Nd7 14. e4) 13. Be2 b5 14. cxb5 Bb7 15. bxc6 Bxc6 16. Bb5 ({This trade is misguided.} 16. Ka1 {was more principled.}) 16... Bxb5 17. Nxb5 Rfc8 18. Nc3 a5 19. Rc1 a4 20. Qd3 Nb6 21. Rc2 Nc4 22. Rhc1 Qb7 23. Ka1 Rcb8 24. Rb1 Na5 25. a3 Nb3+ 26. Ka2 Ra5 27. Nd2 e5 28. dxe5 Bxe5 29. Nf3 Nc5 30. Qe2 Bg7 31. Nd4 {Black is a pawn down but has a menacing-looking attacking position. What should he play?} *

