32. Ka1 {I had counted on this one, and I thought I was good to go. What did I miss?} Qb6 ({This calm retreating move is absolutely devastating. Black is ready to take on d4 and bring the knight to b3 next. E.g.:} 32... g4 {Bxd4 exd4} 33. Nxb3 {.}) 33. Ka2 (33. Nf3 Nb3+ 34. Ka2 d4 {A nice resource.} 35. exd4 g4 {and Black takes on d4 , or Nxd4 Bxd4 exd4 Nxd4-+ .}) 33... Bxd4 34. exd4 Nb3 {Now d4 falls and, once material is equalized, White is in big trouble thanks to his passive position.} *

